msgctxt "chave_ja_roda"
msgid ""
"One thing in your favour: the {1} key service IS ALREADY running on this\n"
"  machine. So that is not what is missing. What is left to check is whether the\n"
"  key is plugged in, and whether the program is 64-bit — in that case there is a\n"
"  known fault where it claims \"debugger detected\" with no debugger present, and\n"
"  the company that made the program is who fixes it, not you and not Tandem."
msgstr ""
"有一点是好消息：{1} 加密锁的服务在这台机器上已经在运行了，所以缺的不是它。\n"
"  还要看的是锁有没有插上，以及程序是不是 64 位的——64 位有一个已知的毛病，会在\n"
"  根本没有调试器的情况下报「检测到调试器」，而能修的是做这个程序的公司，不是您，\n"
"  也不是 Tandem。"

msgctxt "chave_nao_sei"
msgid ""
"I could not check whether the {1} key service is running here (this machine\n"
"  has no \"ss\" tool). If the program complains about a licence, that service is\n"
"  the first thing worth checking."
msgstr ""
"我无法确认 {1} 加密锁的服务在这里有没有在跑（这台机器上没有 \"ss\" 这个工具）。\n"
"  如果程序抱怨授权，先看这个服务最值得。"

msgctxt "chave_nao_roda"
msgid ""
"And I found the likely reason: the {1} key service is NOT running on this\n"
"  machine. It is the one that talks to the USB key from the Linux side — without\n"
"  it, the program looks for the licence and finds nothing, exactly as it would\n"
"  with the key unplugged.\n"
"\n"
"  A technician installs it, once, and it is free: look for\n"
"  \"{2}\" on the manufacturer's site."
msgstr ""
"我找到了很可能的原因：{1} 加密锁的服务在这台机器上没有在运行。它就是在 Linux\n"
"  这一侧跟 USB 锁对话的那个东西——没有它，程序去找授权就什么也找不到，跟没插锁\n"
"  一模一样。\n"
"\n"
"  装它的是技术人员，只装一次，而且免费：在厂商网站上找\n"
"  \"{2}\"。"

