msgstr "这个程序试图直接与硬件通信，而只有系统驱动才能这样做。Wine 让它启动了，但只返回了零，所以它能打开，之后却表现异常"

msgctxt "limite_log_driver"
msgid "this program tried to load a system driver, and Wine runs outside the Linux kernel"
msgstr "这个程序试图加载一个系统驱动，而 Wine 运行在 Linux 内核之外"

msgctxt "arq_memoria_cab1"
msgid "What Tandem learned about this program."
msgstr "Tandem 关于这个程序学到的东西。"

msgctxt "arq_memoria_cab2"
msgid "You can read it, delete it and send it to somebody else."
msgstr "你可以阅读、删除它，也可以发给别人。"

msgctxt "arq_receita_cab1"
msgid "Tandem recipe: what this program needed in order to work."
msgstr "Tandem 配方：这个程序需要什么才能运行。"

msgctxt "arq_receita_cab2"
msgid "You can read it, check it and send it to somebody else."
msgstr "你可以阅读、核对它，也可以发给别人。"

msgctxt "arq_receita_cab3"
msgid "To use it:  tandem receita --importar <this file> <the program>"
msgstr "使用方法：  tandem receita --importar <这个文件> <那个程序>"

msgctxt "arq_config_cab"
msgid "Tandem settings. You can read, edit and delete this file."
msgstr "Tandem 的设置。你可以阅读、编辑和删除这个文件。"

